{"id":"en_the-mafia-wife-s-revenge","title":"The Mafia Wife's Revenge","titleEn":"The Mafia Wife's Revenge","description":"Isabella saw Salvatore as her rescuer. He ended her abusive father's life, constructed a mafia empire on her behalf, and vowed that their union would end only in death, never divorce. Everything shifted when she found 1,800 photographs of another woman. After the mistress took everything Isabella had fought and suffered to safeguard, she retaliated not with tears but with violence. Yet as his treachery comes to light, a far more brutal reality emerges: the child she mourned, the family they had envisioned, and the marriage she was willing to die for had all been shattered by the very man she cherished above all others.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/sf_the-mafia-wifes-revenge/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/sf_the-mafia-wifes-revenge/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu1w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-mafia-wife-s-revenge_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu1w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-mafia-wife-s-revenge_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu1w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-mafia-wife-s-revenge_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu1w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-mafia-wife-s-revenge_4","title"